# Essential Environment Variables for Code Server AI

## AI Provider Configuration (Environment Level)

Set these in your Dokploy Environment Settings:

```bash
# OpenRouter Provider
OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your-openrouter-api-key

# OpenCode Zen Provider
OPENCODE_ZEN_BASE_URL=https://opencode.ai/zen/api/v1
OPENCODE_ZEN_API_KEY=your-opencode-zen-api-key

# FreeLLMAPI Provider
FRELLMAPI_BASE_URL=https://freellmapi:3000/v1
FRELLMAPI_API_KEY=your-freellmapi-api-key

# Anthropic Provider
ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key

# OpenAI Provider
OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key

# Default Provider
DEFAULT_PROVIDER=freellmapi

# Encryption Key (Environment Level)
ENCRYPTION_KEY=generate-with-openssl-rand-hex-32

# RustFS Credentials (Environment Level)
RUSTFS_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key
RUSTFS_SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key
```

## Provider Configuration Notes

- All provider base URLs can be customized by setting the corresponding _BASE_URL variable
- API keys are required for all providers
- The DEFAULT_PROVIDER determines which provider is used initially
- FreeLLMAPI is the default provider but can be changed

## Provider-Specific Configuration

Each provider can be configured individually:

### OpenRouter
- Base URL: https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
- API Key: OPENROUTER_API_KEY

### OpenCode Zen
- Base URL: https://opencode.ai/zen/api/v1
- API Key: OPENCODE_ZEN_API_KEY

### FreeLLMAPI
- Base URL: https://freellmapi:3000/v1
- API Key: FREELLMAPI_API_KEY

### Anthropic
- Base URL: https://api.anthropic.com
- API Key: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY

### OpenAI
- Base URL: https://api.openai.com/v1
- API Key: OPENAI_API_KEY

## Configuration Generation

After setting up your environment variables, run:

```bash
./scripts/generate-configs.sh
```

This will generate the unified configuration based on your environment variables.
